config BR2_PACKAGE_RAWLINK
    bool "rawlink"
    depends on BR2_USE_MMU
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_WAYLAND
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUSB
    help
      rawlink, the host side of the raw livi link: the functionfs gadget
      (vendor video interface + mass storage) and the sender that captures
      the headless weston session over weston_capture_v1.

      Built from the checkout this br2-external tree lives in (the
      rawplay/ directory), so a git pull is all an update needs.

      https://github.com/f-anomaly/ICC2-jailbreak (rawplay/rawlink.c)
